<task id="task-7295" class="- topic/topic task/task "><title class="- topic/title ">Editing assets</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">Learn how to edit your assets using the <ph conkeyref="varsMyGUI/Assetdetailspage" class="- topic/ph "/> page.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><author translate="no" type="creator" class="- topic/author ">Example Author &lt;author@example.com&gt;</author><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><prodinfo class="- topic/prodinfo "><prodname class="- topic/prodname "/><vrmlist class="- topic/vrmlist "><vrm modification="" release="" version="" class="- topic/vrm "/></vrmlist></prodinfo></metadata></prolog><taskbody class="- topic/body task/taskbody "><steps class="- topic/ol task/steps "><step product="classic-MyG" class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Navigate to the <ph conkeyref="varsMyGUI/Assetspage" product="classic-MyG" class="- topic/ph "/> in the main menu.</cmd></step><step product="next-gen-MyG" conref="../../../../Content_Warehouses/MyGeotab/Next-Gen_MyGeotab/Next-Gen_MyGeotab_Navigation_steps.dita#task-8836/step-3315" class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd "/></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Find  the asset you want to edit in the asset list:</cmd><choices class="- topic/ul task/choices "><choice class="- topic/li task/choice ">Search for the asset by name using the search bar.</choice><choice class="- topic/li task/choice ">Open the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Filter</uicontrol> to filter the list by group, asset type, or status to see groups of assets.</choice></choices></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Click the asset name to open the <ph conkeyref="varsMyGUI/Assetdetailspage" class="- topic/ph "/> page.<image href="../../../Images/Managing_Users_and_Vehicles/Asset_details.png" class="- topic/image "><alt class="- topic/alt ">The Asset Details page, showing a variety of the available customizable settings.</alt></image></cmd></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Make your desired changes.</cmd></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Save</uicontrol>.</cmd></step></steps><result class="- topic/section task/result ">Most edits, such as changing an asset's name, are immediately available in <keyword conkeyref="varsProductnames/001" product="classic-MyG" class="- topic/keyword "/><keyword conkeyref="varsProductnames/00101" product="next-gen-MyG" class="- topic/keyword "/>. In instances where changes may take time to process, such as assigning a new driver, a notification banner will let you know that your changes are queued for processing.</result></taskbody><related-links class="- topic/related-links "/></task>